                                                "sense_id": "d7632a5f-1fee-3f9b-ac7f-88cfb78ecf0e",
                                                "text": "We need to find an acceptable present for Jeff."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8132c64a-3160-4b03-a78a-6a44d974b541",
                                                "sense_id": "d7632a5f-1fee-3f9b-ac7f-88cfb78ecf0e",
                                                "text": "I think if post commanders of the unchaplained posts could employ acceptable clergymen […] then the needs might be met."
